     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear colleagues,</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nGiacomo Tavecchia and his group at the IMEDEA in Esporles/Spain are offering a capture-recapture workshop this fall. This is in beautiful Mallorca (for Americans: this is something like Cancun) so hurry up to sign up to the course. Information here below.</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:1.38;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.8;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWe are planning an introductory course on capture-mark-recapture and -recovery (CMRR) analyses, to be held in Mallorca (Spain), 24–28 November 2025.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\"> The course is designed for students, researchers, and environmental managers interested in learning the fundamentals of this\r\n evolving field. No prior knowledge of CMRR methods is required.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\"> At this stage, we are opening a pre-inscription to assess interest and finalize logistics.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\">👉 If you’re interested, please send a short message to\r\n<a style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ng.tav...@uib.es</a> with your name, background, and intention to attend (non-binding).</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\">📌 More details:\r\n<a style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" href=\"https://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492551968000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ogl_jSYFfiSeZb6rQy_k_\">\r\nhttps://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\"> We’ll get back to all pre-registered participants once official registration opens.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\">Thank you</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt\">Giacomo Tavecchia</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
